From ab0b9604e3a2c770ffd8a765782a3e30c98dd15b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:50:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] BOOTWAIT-3 (web): the wait page IS background.html's start-up
 splash (HonPrec banner, slides, progress bar)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 20260929: "一開始不就是要 圖片的畫面嗎? 怎會是程式啟動中的頁面?" -- boot_wait.html now copies #htLoader from background.html
(:117-144 styles, :149-178 markup, the three IMG/ScreenShot slides, same relative paths -- both pages sit in the web root). While
wb_serve boots: the slides rotate every 8 s, the bar follows the elapsed time (never 100%), "HT9xxx 軟體啟動中，完成前無法操作 /
Starting, please wait" and the seconds; when 127.0.0.1:8055 answers it switches to background.html, whose own loader (N / 69)
continues in the same look. Already-running warning and the 3-minute hint kept. Tested in headless Edge over CDP: company image
loaded from file:// (naturalWidth 1091), slide 1 playing, server up at 5 s -> switched within 1 s.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 boot_wait.html | 165 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------
 1 file changed, 113 insertions(+), 52 deletions(-)

